WEBVTT

00:00:03.891 --> 00:00:05.017
-Cho!
-Harry!

00:00:05.268 --> 00:00:07.353
[LAUGHING NERVOUSLY]

00:00:08.354 --> 00:00:11.607
Um, watch yourself on the stairs.
It's a bit icy at the top.

00:00:11.691 --> 00:00:13.401
Okay, thanks.

00:00:17.738 --> 00:00:18.781
Cho?

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.409
-Yes?
-Um....

00:00:22.702 --> 00:00:24.161
Well, I just wondered if you--

00:00:24.412 --> 00:00:25.496
[OWLS SQUAWKING]

00:00:25.663 --> 00:00:27.873
I wondered if maybe
you wanted to go to the ball with me.

00:00:29.709 --> 00:00:31.794
Sorry, I didn't catch that.

00:00:32.712 --> 00:00:37.717
I was just wondering if maybe
you wanted to go to the ball with me.

00:00:39.719 --> 00:00:41.721
Oh, um....

00:00:43.723 --> 00:00:45.308
Harry...

00:00:45.558 --> 00:00:48.311
...I'm sorry, but someone's
already asked me.

00:00:49.312 --> 00:00:50.730
And....

00:00:51.439 --> 00:00:54.734
Well, I've said I'll go with him.

00:00:56.319 --> 00:00:58.779
Okay. Yeah. Great.

00:01:00.197 --> 00:01:02.825
Fine. No problem.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.744
Okay. Good.

00:01:06.329 --> 00:01:07.747
Harry?

00:01:08.539 --> 00:01:10.207
I really am...

00:01:10.458 --> 00:01:12.084
...sorry.

00:01:20.593 --> 00:01:21.677
[SIGHS]

00:01:21.761 --> 00:01:23.346
It's all right, Ron.

00:01:23.596 --> 00:01:26.724
It's okay, Ron. It's all right.
It doesn't matter.

00:01:26.807 --> 00:01:28.768
HARRY:
What happened to you?

00:01:28.976 --> 00:01:31.187
He just asked Fleur Delacour out.

00:01:31.354 --> 00:01:33.773
-What?
-What did she say?

00:01:33.981 --> 00:01:35.441
No, of course.

00:01:36.859 --> 00:01:40.237
-She said yes?
RON: Don't be silly.

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:45.117
There she was, walking by.
You know how I like it when they walk.

00:01:45.785 --> 00:01:49.580
I couldn't help it.
It just sort of slipped out.

00:01:49.747 --> 00:01:53.000
Actually, he sort of screamed at her.
It was a bit frightening.

00:01:54.251 --> 00:01:57.838
-And what did you do then?
-What else? I ran for it.

00:01:58.005 --> 00:02:01.801
I'm not cut out for this, Harry.
I don't know what got into me.

00:02:01.884 --> 00:02:03.219
BOTH:
Hi, Harry.

00:02:03.386 --> 00:02:06.514
RON: I always liked looking at them
from behind.

00:02:07.807 --> 00:02:10.393
She's never gonna forgive me, ever.

00:02:10.851 --> 00:02:11.894
Hey!

00:02:12.603 --> 00:02:15.648
[BALLROOM MUSIC PLAYS]

00:02:17.274 --> 00:02:19.402
[CHATTERING]

00:02:29.036 --> 00:02:30.830
RON:
Bloody hell.

00:02:32.915 --> 00:02:34.834
Bloody hell.

00:02:38.295 --> 00:02:39.672
Bloody....

00:02:39.839 --> 00:02:40.881
Oh, bloody....

00:02:44.802 --> 00:02:47.430
What are those? What are those?

00:02:47.638 --> 00:02:50.683
-My dress robes.
-Well, they're all right!

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:53.769
No lace. No dodgy little collar.

00:02:53.853 --> 00:02:55.855
Well, I expect yours are more traditional.

00:02:55.938 --> 00:03:00.860
Traditional?! They're ancient!
I look like my Great Aunt Tessie!

00:03:02.069 --> 00:03:03.154
[SNIFFS]

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:06.449
I smell like my Great Aunt Tessie.

00:03:11.203 --> 00:03:12.955
Murder me, Harry.

00:03:14.457 --> 00:03:15.916
Leave it alone!

00:03:16.876 --> 00:03:20.337
Poor kid. I bet she's alone in her room,
crying her eyes out.

00:03:20.588 --> 00:03:22.965
-Who?
-Hermione, of course.

00:03:23.215 --> 00:03:26.802
Come on, Harry, why do you think she
wouldn't tell us who she's coming with?

00:03:26.886 --> 00:03:29.096
Because we'd take the mickey out of her
if she did.

00:03:29.346 --> 00:03:34.477
Nobody asked her. Would've taken her
myself if she wasn't so bloody proud.

00:03:35.352 --> 00:03:36.812
BOTH:
Hello, boys.

00:03:36.896 --> 00:03:38.898
Don't you look...

00:03:39.356 --> 00:03:40.608
...dashing.

00:03:41.108 --> 00:03:44.320
There you are, Potter.
Are you and Miss Patil ready?

00:03:44.487 --> 00:03:46.322
-Ready, professor?
-To dance.

00:03:46.489 --> 00:03:49.575
It's traditional that the three
champions-- Well, in this case, four.

00:03:49.742 --> 00:03:50.868
--are the first to dance.

00:03:50.993 --> 00:03:53.746
-Surely I told you that.
-No.

00:03:53.913 --> 00:03:55.956
Oh, well, now you know.

00:03:56.123 --> 00:03:57.583
Oh.

00:03:57.958 --> 00:04:01.837
As for you, Mr. Weasley, you may proceed
into the Great Hall with Miss Patil.

00:04:01.921 --> 00:04:04.340
-Oh, there you are.
-Come on, then.

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:06.008
McGONAGALL:
Come along this way.

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:12.890
Oh, come on.

00:04:13.641 --> 00:04:14.725
Hi.

00:04:14.892 --> 00:04:17.603
Now, I need you all to line up
in the procession, please.

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.104
Oh, you are very late.

00:04:21.357 --> 00:04:23.901
This way. This way. Come along.

00:04:25.402 --> 00:04:27.780
She looks beautiful!

00:04:27.947 --> 00:04:29.406
Yeah, she does.

00:04:53.389 --> 00:04:54.682
[GIGGLES]

00:04:54.932 --> 00:04:56.976
[FANFARE PLAYING]

00:05:16.954 --> 00:05:20.416
Is that Hermione Granger?
With Viktor Krum?

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:23.669
No. Absolutely not.

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:29.967
Hi!

00:05:33.721 --> 00:05:34.597
[BATON TAPPING]

00:05:38.684 --> 00:05:40.603
Harry, take my waist.

00:05:41.478 --> 00:05:42.980
-What?
-Now!

00:05:43.063 --> 00:05:45.190
[ORCHESTRA BEGINS PLAYING]

00:06:03.626 --> 00:06:05.628
[CAT PURRS]

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:25.230
[HUMMING]

00:06:34.114 --> 00:06:35.407
Ooh.

00:06:49.546 --> 00:06:51.256
MAN:
Are you ready?!

00:06:52.049 --> 00:06:54.093
[SINGING]
Move your body like a hairy troll

00:06:55.052 --> 00:06:57.429
Learning to rock and roll

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:00.432
Spin around like a crazy elf

00:07:01.058 --> 00:07:03.102
Dancing by himself

00:07:03.435 --> 00:07:06.897
Boogie down like a unicorn

00:07:07.064 --> 00:07:09.400
No stopping till the break of dawn

00:07:09.566 --> 00:07:12.403
Put your hands up in the air

00:07:12.569 --> 00:07:15.322
Like an ogre who just don't care

00:07:16.115 --> 00:07:18.826
Can you dance like a Hippogriff?

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:23.205
Ruddy pumpkinhead, isn't he?

00:07:25.457 --> 00:07:28.961
I don't think it was the books
that had him going to the library.

00:07:30.838 --> 00:07:32.297
May I have your arm?

00:07:32.464 --> 00:07:35.134
Arm. Leg. I'm yours.

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:02.745
Hot, isn't it?

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:06.749
Viktor's gone to go and get drinks.
Would you care to join us?

00:08:06.999 --> 00:08:10.586
No, we'd not care to join you and Viktor.

00:08:12.212 --> 00:08:14.631
What's got your wand in a knot?

00:08:15.007 --> 00:08:18.594
He's a Durmstrang.
You're fraternizing with the enemy.

00:08:18.761 --> 00:08:22.264
The enemy?
Who was it wanting his autograph?

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:25.476
Besides, the whole point
of the tournament...

00:08:25.642 --> 00:08:29.188
...is international
magical cooperation...

00:08:29.772 --> 00:08:31.231
...to make friends.

00:08:32.149 --> 00:08:35.194
I think he's got a bit more
than friendship on his mind.

00:08:45.204 --> 00:08:47.414
Are you going to ask me
to dance or not?

00:08:47.664 --> 00:08:49.166
No.

00:08:57.257 --> 00:08:59.802
-He's using you.
-How dare you?!

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:04.139
-Besides, I can take care of myself.
-I doubt it. He's way too old.

00:09:04.223 --> 00:09:08.060
-What?! What? That's what you think?
-Yeah, that's what I think.

00:09:08.227 --> 00:09:10.229
You know the solution then, don't you?

00:09:10.395 --> 00:09:12.397
-Go on.
-Next time there's a ball...

00:09:12.564 --> 00:09:15.692
...pluck up the courage and ask me
before somebody else does!

00:09:15.943 --> 00:09:18.028
And not as a last resort.

00:09:18.195 --> 00:09:22.241
Well, that's-- I mean,
that's just completely off the point.

00:09:22.449 --> 00:09:23.826
Harry.

00:09:24.243 --> 00:09:25.536
Where have you been?

00:09:25.702 --> 00:09:28.247
Never mind! Off to bed, both of you.

00:09:28.831 --> 00:09:30.916
[MUSIC PLAYING IN BALLROOM]

00:09:31.208 --> 00:09:35.170
-They get scary when they get older.
-Ron, you spoiled everything!

00:09:35.254 --> 00:09:37.214
What's this about?

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:40.717
[SOBS]
